[
    {
        "content": "<p>dhil opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15148\">PR #15148</a> from <code>dhil:stack-switching-c-api</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've implemented the support for toggling stack switching in the C API with default status <code>OFF</code>. I am not sure what the policy is here wrt to including this change since stack switching is still an experimental feature, although, the proposal is mature (current stage 3). It is helpful to be able to embed wasmtime with stack-switching for benchmarking applications that need host imports.</p>\n<p>Patch notes:</p>\n<p>Enable building the C API with feature <code>stack-switching</code> and expose configuration options for enabling stack switching in the embedding.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 637590691,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1793815226
